  gen image  "prompt" [--model zimage|klein|flux] [--w 1024 --h 1024] [--steps N] [--seed N] [--n 1]
  gen control "prompt" --image ref.png [--mode canny|raw] [--strength 1.0]      (Z-Image + ControlNet Union)
  gen upscale in.png [--method esrgan|ultrasharp|seedvr2] [--scale 4]
  gen video  "prompt" [--image start.png] [--w 1280 --h 704] [--frames 121] [--fps 24] [--steps 20]  (Wan 2.2 5B)
  gen sfx    "prompt" [--seconds 10] [--model sao|sa3]                             (Stable Audio Open 1.0 / Stable Audio 3)
  gen music  "style tags" [--lyrics "..." | --lyrics-file f.txt] [--seconds 120] [--bpm 120]  (ACE-Step 1.5)
  gen status                                                                        (server + queue + which models are present)

Every subcommand: waits for an idle queue (--now skips), submits an API-format prompt,
polls /history, copies outputs into --out (default ~/media-stack/output/<kind>/) and
prints one JSON line: {"ok": true, "files": [...], "seconds": 12.3, "prompt_id": "..."}.
Nothing here calls a cloud API; all inference is the local ComfyUI on :8188.
